{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q4493309","formula":"C₂₁H₂₂ClN₃","hill":"C21H22ClN3","elements":["H","C","N","Cl"],"composition":{"C":21.0,"H":22.0,"N":3.0,"Cl":1.0},"names":{"en":"Carbol fuchsin","ru":"Фукорцин","uk":"Розчин Кастеллані"},"descriptions":{"en":"Carbol fuchsin, carbol-fuchsin, carbolfuchsin, or Castellani's paint is a mixture of phenol and basic fuchsin that is used in bacterial staining procedures. It is commonly used in the staining of mycobacteria because it has an affinity for the mycolic acids found in their cell membranes. It is a component of Ziehl–Neelsen stain, a differential stain.","ru":"Фукорци́н (лат. fucorcinum), или жидкость Кастеллани, или краска Кастеллани — лекарственное средство с антисептическим и противогрибковым действием. Фукорцин обладает характерным ярко-малиновым цветом."},"fame":8,"pubchemCid":5748567,"mass":351.9,"charge":0,"smiles":"CC1=C/C(=C(\\C2=CC=C(C=C2)N)/C3=CC(=C(C=C3)N)C)/C=CC1=N.Cl","inchikey":"HZLHRDBTVSZCBS-UVJJDBRNSA-N","iupac":"4-[(E)-(4-aminophenyl)-(4-imino-3-methylcyclohexa-2,5-dien-1-ylidene)methyl]-2-methylaniline;hydrochloride","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"5748567","atoms":47,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":1.882,"y":4.799,"z":0.292,"el":"C"},{"x":0.718,"y":3.859,"z":0.353,"el":"C"},{"x":0.849,"y":2.524,"z":0.265,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.295,"y":1.602,"z":0.324,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.133,"y":0.248,"z":0.232,"el":"C"},{"x":1.219,"y":-0.351,"z":0.074,"el":"C"},{"x":1.987,"y":-0.673,"z":1.198,"el":"C"},{"x":3.26,"y":-1.231,"z":1.043,"el":"C"},{"x":3.766,"y":-1.516,"z":-0.227,"el":"C"},{"x":3.019,"y":-1.14,"z":-1.347,"el":"C"},{"x":1.745,"y":-0.583,"z":-1.202,"el":"C"},{"x":5.085,"y":-1.961,"z":-0.377,"el":"N"},{"x":-1.306,"y":-0.665,"z":0.287,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.986,"y":-1.016,"z":